    "m1": {"x": -600, "y": 120, "w": 480, "maxH": 560, "text": "M1 · DECRYPT (first visit only)\nThe pixel word in the hero starts as random glyphs from its own charset and resolves left to right in 8 steps of 90ms (720ms total). Width is locked to the final word so nothing reflows. Plays once per browser (sessionStorage flag). Screen readers get the final text from the start (aria-label on the h1, glyph spans aria-hidden).\nReduced motion: final word, no animation.", "fill": "orange", "page": "pages"},
    "m2": {"x": -600, "y": 820, "w": 480, "maxH": 560, "text": "M2 · INDEX MARKER\nOne 7px square per rail. An IntersectionObserver sets --i on the list when a section crosses 40% of the viewport. The marker translates Y by --i × 36px over 320ms cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1). Clicking an item uses native anchor jumps (no smooth-scroll hijack).\nReduced motion: the marker jumps instantly.", "fill": "orange", "page": "pages"},
    "m3": {"x": -600, "y": 1600, "w": 480, "maxH": 560, "text": "M3 · CARD TILT IN\nCards start at perspective(1200px) rotateX(8deg) + translateY(32px), opacity 0. When 20% visible they ease to their resting tilt (−1.5° / +1.25°) over 600ms, staggered 80ms. Hover or focus: flat, lift 4px, accent border, arrow nudges 4px.\nReduced motion: resting tilt from the start, hover changes border only.", "fill": "orange", "page": "pages"},
    "m4": {"x": -600, "y": 2300, "w": 480, "maxH": 560, "text": "M4 · PIXEL DISSOLVE (page change)\nCross-document View Transitions (@view-transition { navigation: auto }). The new page is revealed through 8 Bayer-threshold mask tiles stepped over 360ms (steps(8)). The old page holds still underneath. Browsers without support just navigate.\nReduced motion: no transition.", "fill": "orange", "page": "pages"},
    "m5": {"x": -600, "y": 3000, "w": 480, "maxH": 560, "text": "M5 · DITHERED FIELD (optional, hero only)\nA 1-bit Bayer field at 6% opacity behind the headline. On pointer move, a CSS variable offsets a radial mask so the field bends toward the cursor (max 24px, rAF-throttled, pointer: fine only). Pauses when the hero leaves the viewport.\nReduced motion or touch: static field, no tracking.", "fill": "orange", "page": "pages"},
    "m6": {"x": -600, "y": 3700, "w": 480, "maxH": 420, "text": "STATUS DOT\nThe 6px accent square in the status pill pulses with a 1px ring: 2.4s loop, steps(6) so it reads as pixels, not a glow.\nReduced motion: solid dot, no ring.\n\nNever: content-blocking loaders, scroll hijacking, custom cursors.", "fill": "orange", "page": "pages"}
  },
